<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Maritime QA — Agentic Pipeline</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Syne:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --navy: #0a1628;
    --navy-mid: #0d2040;
    --navy-light: #153060;
    --steel: #1e3a5f;
    --ocean: #0066cc;
    --ocean-bright: #0088ff;
    --aqua: #00d4aa;
    --aqua-dim: #00a884;
    --amber: #f5a623;
    --amber-dim: #c8841a;
    --red-alert: #ff4455;
    --green-ok: #22dd88;
    --text-primary: #e8f0fe;
    --text-secondary: #7a9cc4;
    --text-muted: #3d5a80;
    --border: rgba(0,180,255,0.15);
    --border-bright: rgba(0,180,255,0.35);
    --glass: rgba(13,32,64,0.7);
    --glass-light: rgba(21,48,96,0.5);
  }
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    background: var(--navy);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
 
  /* Animated ocean background */
  body::before {
    content: '';
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 50% at 50% 100%, rgba(0,102,204,0.12) 0%, transparent 70%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 40% 30% at 20% 60%, rgba(0,212,170,0.06) 0%, transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 40% at 80% 20%, rgba(0,102,204,0.08) 0%, transparent 60%);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }
 
  /* Scan lines */
  body::after {
    content: '';
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(
      0deg,
      transparent,
      transparent 3px,
      rgba(0,0,0,0.03) 3px,
      rgba(0,0,0,0.03) 4px
    );
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }
 
  /* Top navigation */
  .topbar {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 0 24px;
    height: 52px;
    background: rgba(10,22,40,0.95);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .topbar-logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  .anchor-icon {
    width: 28px; height: 28px;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--aqua);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--aqua);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .topbar-tabs {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2px;
    margin-left: 16px;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .topbar-tab {
    padding: 6px 14px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    cursor: pointer;
    border-radius: 4px;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
  }
  .topbar-tab.active {
    color: var(--aqua);
    background: rgba(0,212,170,0.08);
    border-color: rgba(0,212,170,0.2);
  }
  .topbar-tab:hover:not(.active) { color: var(--text-secondary); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); }
  .topbar-status {
    margin-left: auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  }
  .status-dot {
    width: 7px; height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: pulse 2s infinite;
  }
  .status-dot.green { background: var(--green-ok); box-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--green-ok); }
  .status-dot.amber { background: var(--amber); box-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--amber); }
  @keyframes pulse {
    0%,100% { opacity: 1; }
    50% { opacity: 0.4; }
  }
 
  /* Main layout */
  .main-layout {
    display: flex;
    flex: 1;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
 
  /* Left sidebar */
  .sidebar {
    width: 220px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    background: rgba(10,22,40,0.9);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 12px 0;
  }
  .sidebar-section {
    padding: 8px 12px 4px;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .sidebar-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.15s;
    border-left: 2px solid transparent;
    margin: 1px 0;
  }
  .sidebar-item:hover { color: var(--text-primary); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); }
  .sidebar-item.active {
    color: var(--aqua);
    background: rgba(0,212,170,0.07);
    border-left-color: var(--aqua);
  }
  .sidebar-item .icon { width: 16px; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; }
  .badge {
    margin-left: auto;
    padding: 2px 7px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  }
  .badge.green { background: rgba(34,221,136,0.15); color: var(--green-ok); }
  .badge.amber { background: rgba(245,166,35,0.15); color: var(--amber); }
  .badge.red { background: rgba(255,68,85,0.15); color: var(--red-alert); }
 
  /* Center content */
  .content {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
 
  /* Pipeline description area */
  .pipeline-desc {
    padding: 16px 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: rgba(13,32,64,0.4);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .desc-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .desc-text {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .desc-text strong { color: var(--text-primary); }
  .desc-textarea {
    width: 100%;
    background: rgba(21,48,96,0.3);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    resize: vertical;
    min-height: 80px;
    outline: none;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .desc-textarea:focus { border-color: var(--border-bright); }
 
  /* Run button */
  .run-btn {
    margin-top: 10px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--aqua-dim), var(--aqua));
    color: var(--navy);
    border: none;
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 10px 24px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .run-btn:hover { filter: brightness(1.1); transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .run-btn:active { transform: translateY(0); }
  .run-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; transform: none; }
  .run-btn .spinner { display: none; }
  .run-btn.loading .spinner { display: inline-block; }
  .run-btn.loading .btn-text { display: none; }
  @keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
  .spinner-icon { animation: spin 0.8s linear infinite; display: inline-block; }
 
  /* Agent pipeline flow */
  .agent-flow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .agent-node {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    min-width: 90px;
  }
  .agent-node-box {
    width: 64px; height: 40px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 18px;
    transition: all 0.3s;
    position: relative;
  }
  .agent-node-box.active {
    border-color: var(--aqua);
    background: rgba(0,212,170,0.1);
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0,212,170,0.2);
  }
  .agent-node-box.done {
    border-color: var(--green-ok);
    background: rgba(34,221,136,0.08);
  }
  .agent-node-box.waiting { opacity: 0.4; }
  .agent-node-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-align: center;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .agent-node-label.active { color: var(--aqua); }
  .agent-node-label.done { color: var(--green-ok); }
  .agent-arrow {
    width: 24px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--border);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .agent-arrow::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    right: -4px; top: -3px;
    width: 0; height: 0;
    border-left: 6px solid var(--border);
    border-top: 3px solid transparent;
    border-bottom: 3px solid transparent;
  }
  .agent-arrow.active { background: var(--aqua); }
  .agent-arrow.active::after { border-left-color: var(--aqua); }
 
  /* Output panel */
  .output-area {
    flex: 1;
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 16px 20px;
  }
  .output-section {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .output-section-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .agent-tag {
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  .tag-orchestrator { background: rgba(0,212,170,0.15); color: var(--aqua); border: 1px solid rgba(0,212,170,0.3); }
  .tag-compliance { background: rgba(245,166,35,0.15); color: var(--amber); border: 1px solid rgba(245,166,35,0.3); }
  .tag-report { background: rgba(0,136,255,0.15); color: var(--ocean-bright); border: 1px solid rgba(0,136,255,0.3); }
  .tag-tool { background: rgba(255,68,85,0.12); color: #ff8899; border: 1px solid rgba(255,68,85,0.25); }
 
  .output-card {
    background: rgba(13,32,64,0.5);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .output-card-inner {
    padding: 14px 16px;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  .output-card-inner strong { color: var(--text-primary); }
 
  /* Compliance items */
  .compliance-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
  .compliance-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .compliance-item.pass { background: rgba(34,221,136,0.07); border-left: 2px solid var(--green-ok); }
  .compliance-item.warn { background: rgba(245,166,35,0.07); border-left: 2px solid var(--amber); }
  .compliance-item.fail { background: rgba(255,68,85,0.07); border-left: 2px solid var(--red-alert); }
  .compliance-status {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    margin-top: 1px;
    min-width: 36px;
  }
  .compliance-status.pass { color: var(--green-ok); }
  .compliance-status.warn { color: var(--amber); }
  .compliance-status.fail { color: var(--red-alert); }
  .compliance-body { color: var(--text-secondary); }
  .compliance-body strong { color: var(--text-primary); }
 
  /* Report grid */
  .report-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .report-metric {
    background: rgba(10,22,40,0.7);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .metric-val {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  }
  .metric-val.green { color: var(--green-ok); }
  .metric-val.amber { color: var(--amber); }
  .metric-val.red { color: var(--red-alert); }
  .metric-val.blue { color: var(--ocean-bright); }
  .metric-label { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
 
  /* Memory log */
  .memory-log {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .memory-log .mem-key { color: var(--aqua); }
  .memory-log .mem-val { color: var(--text-secondary); }
 
  /* Tool call visualization */
  .tool-call {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    background: rgba(255,68,85,0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,68,85,0.15);
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    margin: 4px 0;
  }
  .tool-call .tc-name { color: #ff8899; }
  .tool-call .tc-args { color: var(--text-muted); }
  .tool-call .tc-result { color: var(--green-ok); margin-left: auto; }
 
  /* Right panel - History */
  .history-panel {
    width: 220px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    background: rgba(10,22,40,0.9);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .history-header {
    padding: 12px 16px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .history-list { overflow-y: auto; flex: 1; padding: 8px 0; }
  .history-item {
    padding: 8px 16px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.15s;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
  }
  .history-item:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); }
  .history-item.active { background: rgba(0,212,170,0.06); }
  .history-title {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .history-meta {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .history-dot {
    width: 5px; height: 5px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
 
  /* Scrollbar */
  ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 4px; height: 4px; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--border); border-radius: 2px; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: var(--border-bright); }
 
  /* Loading animation */
  .thinking-dots span {
    animation: blink 1.2s infinite;
    color: var(--aqua);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .thinking-dots span:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
  .thinking-dots span:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
  @keyframes blink { 0%,80%,100% { opacity: 0; } 40% { opacity: 1; } }
 
  .fade-in { animation: fadeIn 0.4s ease forwards; }
  @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
 
  /* Placeholder */
  .empty-state {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    height: 100%;
    gap: 12px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .empty-state .big-icon { font-size: 40px; opacity: 0.3; }
 
  /* Pre-built prompts */
  .prompt-chips {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .prompt-chip {
    padding: 5px 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.15s;
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
  }
  .prompt-chip:hover { border-color: var(--border-bright); color: var(--text-primary); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); }
 
  /* Divider */
  .divider { height: 1px; background: var(--border); margin: 12px 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
 
<!-- Top nav -->
<div class="topbar">
  <div class="topbar-logo">
    <div class="anchor-icon">⚓</div>
    Maritime QA
  </div>
  <div class="topbar-tabs">
    <div class="topbar-tab active" onclick="switchTab('pipeline', this)">Pipeline</div>
    <div class="topbar-tab" onclick="switchTab('agents', this)">Agents</div>
    <div class="topbar-tab" onclick="switchTab('memory', this)">Memory</div>
    <div class="topbar-tab" onclick="switchTab('logs', this)">Logs</div>
  </div>
  <div class="topbar-status">
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px">
      <div class="status-dot green" id="api-status-dot"></div>
      <span id="api-status-text">API Connected</span>
    </div>
    <span style="color:var(--text-muted)">|</span>
    <span id="run-count" style="color:var(--text-muted)">0 runs</span>
  </div>
</div>
 
<!-- Main layout -->
<div class="main-layout">
 
  <!-- Left sidebar -->
  <div class="sidebar">
    <div class="sidebar-section">Departments</div>
    <div class="sidebar-item active" onclick="selectDept(this, 'All Departments')">
      <span class="icon">🌐</span> All Departments
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar-item" onclick="selectDept(this, 'Naval QA')">
      <span class="icon">⚓</span> Naval QA <span class="badge green">OK</span>
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar-item" onclick="selectDept(this, 'Ports & Harbors')">
      <span class="icon">🏗️</span> Ports & Harbors <span class="badge amber">3</span>
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar-item" onclick="selectDept(this, 'Maritime Safety')">
      <span class="icon">🛡️</span> Maritime Safety <span class="badge green">OK</span>
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar-item" onclick="selectDept(this, 'Compliance Report')">
      <span class="icon">📋</span> Compliance Report
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar-item" onclick="selectDept(this, 'Execution Logs')">
      <span class="icon">📟</span> Execution Logs
    </div>
 
    <div class="sidebar-section" style="margin-top:12px">Tools</div>
    <div class="sidebar-item" onclick="selectDept(this, 'IMO Regulations DB')">
      <span class="icon">📚</span> IMO Reg DB
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar-item" onclick="selectDept(this, 'Vessel Inspector')">
      <span class="icon">🔍</span> Vessel Inspector
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar-item" onclick="selectDept(this, 'Route Planner')">
      <span class="icon">🗺️</span> Route Planner
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar-item" onclick="selectDept(this, 'Incident Database')">
      <span class="icon">⚠️</span> Incident Database <span class="badge red">2</span>
    </div>
 
    <div class="sidebar-section" style="margin-top:12px">Agents</div>
    <div class="sidebar-item">
      <span class="icon" style="color:var(--aqua)">●</span> Orchestrator
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar-item">
      <span class="icon" style="color:var(--amber)">●</span> Compliance Agent
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar-item">
      <span class="icon" style="color:var(--ocean-bright)">●</span> Report Agent
    </div>
  </div>
 
  <!-- Center content -->
  <div class="content">
 
    <!-- Pipeline description -->
    <div class="pipeline-desc">
      <div class="desc-label">Pipeline Description</div>
      <div class="desc-text">
        <strong>IMO / SOLAS Compliance Analyzer</strong> — Automated maritime safety assessment pipeline using multi-agent AI with memory, tool-calling, and compliance reporting.
      </div>
      <textarea class="desc-textarea" id="pipeline-input" placeholder="Describe your maritime QA task (e.g. 'Analyze vessel MV-447 cargo stowage for SOLAS compliance and generate a full report')">To analyze vessel cargo stowage plan and run compliance checks reporting against SOLAS maritime safety standards</textarea>
      <div class="prompt-chips">
        <div class="prompt-chip" onclick="setPrompt('SOLAS fire safety check for passenger vessel MV Pacific Star, 847 passengers, 12 crew')">🔥 SOLAS Fire Safety</div>
        <div class="prompt-chip" onclick="setPrompt('ISM Code audit for bulk carrier Orion II — check SMS documentation, drill records, and maintenance logs')">📋 ISM Code Audit</div>
        <div class="prompt-chip" onclick="setPrompt('MARPOL Annex VI emission compliance check for tanker vessel — NOx, SOx and CO2 reporting')">🌊 MARPOL Emissions</div>
        <div class="prompt-chip" onclick="setPrompt('Port State Control inspection checklist for MV Horizon Dawn arriving Chennai port')">⚓ PSC Inspection</div>
      </div>
      <button class="run-btn" id="run-btn" onclick="runPipeline()">
        <span class="btn-text">▶ RUN PIPELINE</span>
        <span class="spinner"><span class="spinner-icon">↻</span> Running pipeline…</span>
      </button>
    </div>
 
    <!-- Agent flow -->
    <div class="agent-flow" id="agent-flow">
      <div class="agent-node">
        <div class="agent-node-box waiting" id="node-input">📥</div>
        <div class="agent-node-label waiting" id="lbl-input">Input</div>
      </div>
      <div class="agent-arrow" id="arr-1"></div>
      <div class="agent-node">
        <div class="agent-node-box waiting" id="node-orch">🧠</div>
        <div class="agent-node-label waiting" id="lbl-orch">Orchestrator</div>
      </div>
      <div class="agent-arrow" id="arr-2"></div>
